title: the reasons and particulars of each step of the planning procedure
pid: 1d4b3934-5e6f-40c4-8bf6-2fd3e9b837b6
body: |2-
  Cut from [[id:6b88547d-78a8-4a64-a7e7-b754b201d97a][the planning procedure]] on 2026-11-13, when Top asked for it on one page.
  "Read" means a published source says it, in [[id:b034bd82-6ed1-48cb-81d5-d492db9209b3][what I read]];
  "ours" means I inferred it from how this team is shaped, often
  departing from a source, in [[id:7c1c9b52-05d2-4d67-8891-b1f937b06b39][where the procedure departs from its sources]];
  "first use" means what happened in Vic's plan for Jeff's three
  diff-view changes, [[id:f50a9d64-4d8d-45f9-ae97-d855853876d5][Vic's plan]], as its builders reported.
